    "report_markdown": "# Hypora run report: run_1c3888bdc7a0\n\n**Outcome:** a verified model.\n\n## Verification and limitations\n**Verification:** passed: every verifier check that ran passed.\nThe agent's text below does not change this verdict.\n\n**Skipped checks**\n| Check | Status | Detail |\n|---|---|---|\n| learned_transform_leakage | skipped | static analysis of fit/predict is not implemented (D-044 8.4; a mandatory report limitation) |\n\n**Limitations (written by the platform)**\n- The learned-transform leakage check is not implemented: transforms fitted inside a pipeline were not checked for leakage from the evaluation folds or the test split.\n- The plan was approved by policy (auto_within_contract) within the request's bounds, without a human decision.\n- The test split was scored once, for the final candidate only; every other trial has validation scores only.\n- The report has no agent narrative.\n\n**Approval:** approved by `policy:auto_within_contract` under policy `auto_within_contract` (contract v1); approval `appr_run_1c3888bdc7a0_plan_v1`, plan hash `9b2581076914`.\n\n## Task\n- Objective: Identify which bank clients will subscribe to a term deposit, so that the bank can decide whom to call in its marketing campaign. Each prediction is made before the client is called, from the client's profile and account details, the planned contact, and the record of earlier contacts; what happens during the call itself is not known when the prediction is made.\n- Target: `y` (binary_classification)\n- Primary metric: `roc_auc` (maximize)\n\n_No narrative: the fixed-pipeline baseline makes no model calls._\n\n## Final model\n- Trial `trl_1ac64095`: Default HistGradientBoosting on every column with a random split.\n- Verified: yes\n\n| Metric | Test (once) | Validation (mean) |\n|---|---|---|\n| roc_auc | 0.9306 | 0.9230 |\n| accuracy | 0.9101 | 0.9073 |\n| balanced_accuracy | 0.7152 | 0.7077 |\n| precision | 0.6789 | 0.6440 |\n| recall | 0.4596 | 0.4480 |\n| f1 | 0.5481 | 0.5278 |\n| precision_macro | 0.8046 | 0.7872 |\n| recall_macro | 0.7152 | 0.7077 |\n| f1_macro | 0.7491 | 0.7382 |\n| pr_auc | 0.6351 | 0.5993 |\n| log_loss | 0.2032 | 0.2087 |\n| brier_score | 0.0627 | 0.0645 |\n\n| Check | Status | Detail |\n|---|---|---|\n| allowed_features | passed | trial code received exactly the contract's allowed features |\n| split_respected | passed | random split: disjoint, complete |\n| test_labels_not_accessed | passed | every predict stage saw features and the model only |\n| output_shape | passed | one prediction per planned row, task-shaped columns |\n| finite_outputs | passed | all predictions finite and well-formed |\n| metric_recomputation | passed | recomputed metrics match the harness |\n| artifact_loads | passed | the frozen model loaded in a sandbox and predicted the test split |\n| resource_limits | passed | every stage completed inside the submitted job's limits |\n| learned_transform_leakage | skipped | static analysis of fit/predict is not implemented (D-044 8.4; a mandatory report limitation) |\n\n## Trials\n| Trial | Kind | Status | Validation roc_auc (mean \u00b1 std, folds) | Hypothesis |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `trl_1ac64095` | baseline | verified | 0.9230 \u00b1 0.0014 (3) | Default HistGradientBoosting on every column with a random split. |\n\n## Data\n- Split: random, 20% test, kfold_3\n- Features used: 16; excluded: none\n- Leakage screen: leakage not screened: the profile is built before the split is locked and never reads the target; leakage may be examined by C's optional diagnostics on the locked partition.\n\n## Resources (up to the start of reporting)\n- Cost: $0.0000 of $0.60 at list price; LLM tokens: 0\n- Model calls: 0; tool calls: 2\n- Sandbox compute: 68.9 s of 1800 s; wall clock: 87.2 s\n- Trials: 1; jobs: 2\n\n## Decision and faults\n- Decision: train (approved_plan)\n\n## Run notes\n- Fixed-pipeline baseline (spec \u00a719.3): random split, every column but the forbidden ones, default HistGradientBoosting, one trial. Contract built by code, plan approved by policy.\n- Final candidate trl_1ac64095: best mean validation roc_auc.\n- Final job job_1795302505856315021_b0359f: test split scored once; verifier v1 passed.\n\n## Sources\n- `task_spec:run_1c3888bdc7a0.v1`\n- `profile:run_1c3888bdc7a0.profile.984136ffedb9`\n- `experiment_contract:run_1c3888bdc7a0.v1`\n- `result:trl_1ac64095/test`\n"
